#: app/page/effects.js:104
msgid "Why is there no “square corners” mode?"
msgstr ""

#: app/page/effects.js:105
msgid ""
"Apps draw their own rounded top corners; the pixels outside that curve do "
"not exist, and an effect can only remove pixels — never invent window "
"content. Uniformity is therefore achieved by rounding the flat corners to "
"match."
msgstr ""

